@startuml fig1_communication
' Diagram 1 of the ISO/IEC 7498-1 pattern: a communication and what it promises.
'
' Conventions: shared/FIGURES.md. Flat boxes, no namespace prefixes, no clause
' numbers, orthogonal edges, nothing explanatory inside the drawing.
'
' What it shows: what a communication connects, the two transmission modes, the
' direction it runs in, and the quality of service it states.
'
' The association is the anchor of the pattern. Everything a model says about a
' communication hangs off it, and the two subclasses are the one distinction
' the standard makes that changes what else can be said: a connectionless
' transmission carries no state between units, 5.8.4.
'
' The quality of service is reified twice over. A communication has one, that
' one holds values, and each value names the parameter it quantifies. Without
' that a model could state a number and not what it is a number of.
'
' Left out on purpose:
'  - the architecture inside an open system: diagram 2
'  - the data units a communication transmits: diagram 3

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam padding 3
skinparam ArrowColor #1A2733
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1A2733
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FCEFC7
  BorderColor #C9A227
  FontColor #1A2733
  FontSize 14
  BorderThickness 1
}

' ===================================================================
'  What a communication is, and between what
' ===================================================================

class Association
class ConnectionModeAssociation
class ConnectionlessModeAssociation
class OpenSystem
class Technology

Association <|-- ConnectionModeAssociation
Association <|-- ConnectionlessModeAssociation

Association --> "*" OpenSystem : connects
Association --> "*" Technology : usesTechnology

class CommunicationDirection {
  «enum»
  OneWay
  TwoWayAlternate
  TwoWaySimultaneous
}

Association --> "1" CommunicationDirection : hasDirection

' ===================================================================
'  What it promises
' ===================================================================

class QualityOfService
class QoSValue {
  dataProp: quantity
  dataProp: unit
}
class QoSParameter {
  «enum»
  Throughput
  TransitDelay
  EstablishmentDelay
  ResidualErrorRate
  Availability
  Jitter
  Priority
}

Association      --> "*" QualityOfService : hasQualityOfService
QualityOfService --> "*" QoSValue         : hasValue
QoSValue         --> "1" QoSParameter     : forParameter

' Layout only.
ConnectionModeAssociation -[hidden]right- ConnectionlessModeAssociation

@enduml
